  "solution": "**Given Data:**\n\nEquation: 96 of 10 - 40 + 19 ÷ [{70 + (40 - 22) ÷ 3} ÷ 4]\n\nConcept used:\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/47485e25d1b30c57dc271863db8b99be0c8e209069b2596cc885911d898a8a78.png] \n\n**Calculation:**\n\n⇒ 96 of 10 - 40 + 19 ÷ [{70 + (40 - 22) ÷ 3} ÷ 4]\n\n⇒ 96 × 10 - 40 + 19 ÷ [{70 + 18 ÷ 3} ÷ 4]\n\n⇒ 960 - 40 + 19 ÷ 19\n\n⇒ 960 - 39\n\n⇒ 921\n\n**Hence, the value is 921.**",
